              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Motto: Stay ahead of trends! Always!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Activity Involvement:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Managing stage affairs during the band performance at the music party."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ce9b3a06962d4f98"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Messages from Classmates]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dafanchy:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A dedicated peer taking responsibilities seriously! I hope we'll work together again in the future!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9a576076373e7e3f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Arfey:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Thank you for your unwavering support for The Dazzling. May our performances bring you joy!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1737809836b885f0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Czipo:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Well, allow me to make this clear: we won't disband our band. So, you're always welcome to in our future performances, Miss Secretary."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-86aa1e0715e58a35"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(Trailblazer):"
