                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Activity Involvement:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Participating in the stage performance at the music party as one of the guitarists for the band (Dazzling Band/Dazzling Collective/Dazzling Airship/Dazzling Initiate Hotel/Dazzling School Party)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e341c5b2f8df0cdb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Messages from Classmates]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Czipo:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just don't be too formal. Drop by my party when you can! It's a great way to find your muse and get connected with your music-loving peers!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3f69721aa5c00376"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dafanchy:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May you always shine in your pursuit of your dreams and create music you truly love. I'll always cherish the moments shared with you."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cf2f7f2008d0992e"
          },
          {
