              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How about giving me, your dear classmate, a discount? Haha! Don't forget to join me in the party next time."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6848ba655a85e803"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chad:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
